{"id":"ataque","lemma":"ataque","pos":"noun","rank":630,"glosses":["attack (an attempt to damage an opponent or enemy)","attack, offensive","attack (the sudden onset of a disease or condition)"],"ipa":"/aˈtake/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ataques"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ataque.wav","examples":[{"text":"Se impidió el ataque.","en":"The attack was foiled.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301887"},{"text":"¿Tiene usted ataques de vértigo?","en":"Do you have attacks of dizziness?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684328"},{"text":"Tuve un ataque de asma.","en":"I had an asthma attack.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38936"},{"text":"La falta de sueño aumenta el riesgo de ataques cardíacos.","en":"Sleep deprivation increases risk of heart attacks.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594284"},{"text":"Planeó el ataque con cuidado.","en":"He planned the attack carefully.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645468"}]}